      "user_id": 75459,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768840136933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Blisters can certainly be uncomfortable. Is it a technical fault with the shoe itself, or more of a sizing and preference issue? Sometimes adjusting the cleats can make a big difference in fit.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768840140066665
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know. I just want a refund. The shoes are bad.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 75459,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768840154733331
    },
    {
